note tools/estimation/est3c_fit.om -- EST-3c protocol v3, section 5: the D1 fit
note (docs/estimation/EST3C_PROTOCOL_V3.md). Pure seeded OM-2 replacement for est3c_fit.c.
note Composed after: est_defs.om est_math.om est_types.om est_kf.om est_mix.om
note                 est_pred.om est_v4.om est_replay.om est3c_common.om <toolid_v3.om>.

const C3F_NQ ulong 25
const C3F_NR ulong 17
const C3F_NC2 ulong 4
const C3F_NNU3 ulong 10
const C3F_NS3 ulong 51
const C3F_NL5 ulong 7
const C3F_NNU5 ulong 7
const C3F_NC5 ulong 21
const C3F_NF5 ulong 3

